WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.176
A first-contact MSK clinician sees a new knee injury.

2
00:00:04.176 --> 00:00:08.677
A made-up NHS number brings up a test patient. Orwyn will not go on until a side is picked.

3
00:00:08.677 --> 00:00:12.678
How the injury happened is recorded with a tap.

4
00:00:12.678 --> 00:00:17.679
The safety questions come first. No result until the clinician has confirmed them.

5
00:00:17.679 --> 00:00:21.681
History and examination are recorded in taps.

6
00:00:21.681 --> 00:00:26.182
Each examination test has a short guide to how it is done.

7
00:00:26.182 --> 00:00:31.183
Orwyn gives the most likely diagnosis, its reasons and what to do today.

8
00:00:31.183 --> 00:00:35.185
The clinician decides. Agree or change, and the record keeps both.

9
00:00:35.185 --> 00:00:39.687
Every letter is drafted for the clinician to check.

10
00:00:39.687 --> 00:00:43.690
The patient gets a page in plain words.

11
00:00:43.690 --> 00:00:49.191
It is sent by text message or email, or printed to take home.

12
00:00:49.191 --> 00:00:52.692
Orwyn. Surgical decision support for first-contact MSK clinicians.
